<p>A list of icons available. Each name should be preceded with /OpenForum/Image/icons/gif and   followed by the .gif extension. For example:
<xmp class="panel" of-exclude="true"><a href="/OpenForum/Images/icons/gif/printer.gif">/OpenForum/Images/icons/gif/printer.gif</a></xmp> renders as <a href="/OpenForum/Images/icons/gif/printer.gif">/OpenForum/Images/icons/gif/printer.gif</a></p>

These icons are designed by Mark James at <a href="http://www.famfamfam.com" target="external_page">http://www.famfamfam.com</a> and are licensed under a <a href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5/" target="external_page">Creative Commons Attribution 2.5 License.</a>
<br/><br/><br/><br/>

<img src="/OpenForum/Images/index_abc.png"/>

<hr/>
<h3>Extension Icon Input Field</h3>
